WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.640
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind windows desktop interface.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:12.146
Desktop: is a main computer work area. Icon: is a small picture representing an item.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:17.863
Taskbar: helps find open apps and tools. Wallpaper: is the desktop background

00:00:17.863 --> 00:00:21.547
picture. Start menu: offers a way to open programs.

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:27.081
With an adult supervising, practise desktop and icon using a computer if one is

00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:31.796
available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each step to a partner.
